      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since blacklists aren't allowed, as stated in the Creator Guidelines, I think you just answered why this isn't a feature yet. But even if Udon couldn't get the name of users with this feature, it could still be used for callouts or similar, so there are a lot of potentially malicious uses to be considered.\n\nOther than that, I like the idea.",
