  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So right now there is a button that can be used to open a vrc group. However it would be nice, if something similar could be done with actual users.\n\nLike imgine making a credits list that automatically updates itself by fetching the displayname of the users its connected to.\n\nNaturally this could also be used for blacklists as well.",
